{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/941043-breaking-into-an-autumn-library","id":941043,"title":"Breaking into an Autumn Library","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-31T22:39:45-07:00","id":941043,"title":"Breaking into an Autumn Library","content":"I don't deal with Changeling as much as the other splats so my knowledge of them is tenuous at best. But I <i>do</i> know that Autumn is the Court that tends to deal the most with magic and that sort of things. So what sorts of defenses could they bring to bear on a library. What sort of wards and traps and guardians would they typically have?<br /> <br /> I'm really just looking for ideas of the sort of things that are possible, but if you had specific books and page numbers that would be a bonus, I could borrow any of them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2523-tiarn","name":"Tiarn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T16:26:57-07:00","id":943090,"title":"","content":"Is the library in the material realm? Or in the Hedge?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-03T17:47:08-07:00","id":943163,"title":"","content":"I ask because weirder defenses are to be more easily erected in the Hedge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T05:41:48-07:00","id":943562,"title":"","content":"One of the hard parts if it's in the Hedge is finding the right doorway and figuring out the &quot;key&quot; to open it. The Autumn Court is likely to do a good job of keeping their library's key secret and unlikely to happen by accident. Possible keys include a special knock, an occult password, a small ritual, and carrying or displaying a certain item or symbol.<br /> <br /> Defenses beyond that could include hedgebeast or hobgoblin guards pledged to capture/kill trespassers. One hobgoblin I've considered for a Hedge encounter is a talking door who won't let just anyone through and protests quite loudly if anyone tries to pick his lock. There's also Contracts of the Den, which deal with home safety, which includes an intruder alarm, and goes up to collapsing the place on invaders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-04T14:26:57-07:00","id":943875,"title":"","content":"1e or 2e? <br /> <br /> If 2e a Courts best magical librabries are going to be in the hedge, likely in a Hollow.<br /> <br /> I suggest checking out the hollow merit in the playtest doc and the hob kin merit above it (for hob alarm), also it might have an orger of the Troll Kith guarding it. The troll can turn the hollow into a safe space with traps.<br /> <br /> It might have hedgespun automations, dangerous fierce Hedge Beasts guarding its secrets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}